  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_08_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "E61208A4A4133A8B",
      "text": "Bonjour, les enfants ! Vous vous souvenez que\\nvous passez le contrôle final, aujourd’hui ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_08_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "E61209A4A4133C3E",
      "text": "Attention, il porte sur tout le programme, mais\\nje suis sûr que vous allez très bien vous en sortir.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_08_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "E6120AA4A4133DF1",
      "text": "Bon, il va falloir s’y mettre. Comme toujours,\\nprenez votre temps pour répondre aux questions.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_01",
      "hash64": "C4460BAE4D4FFF9D",
      "text": "1. Combien de ces méthodes facilitent la capture\\nde Pokémon ?\\nParalyser un Pokémon ; se servir du Poké Plumet ;\\ndonner une Baie à un Pokémon ; attaquer un\\nPokémon par-derrière.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_01a",
      "hash64": "1F43BA9C75CDEB85",
      "text": "A) Une",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_01b",
      "hash64": "1F43B79C75CDE66C",
      "text": "B) Deux",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_01c",
      "hash64": "1F43B89C75CDE81F",
      "text": "C) Trois",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_01d",
      "hash64": "1F43B59C75CDE306",
      "text": "D) Quatre",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_02",
      "hash64": "C44608AE4D4FFA84",
      "text": "2. Vrai ou Faux ? Les seuls moyens de rencontrer\\nde nouveaux Pokémon sont la capture et les\\néchanges.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_02a",
      "hash64": "1F3FD29C75CA2B76",
      "text": "A) Vrai",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_02b",
      "hash64": "1F3FD19C75CA29C3",
      "text": "B) Faux",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_03",
      "hash64": "C44609AE4D4FFC37",
      "text": "3. Si l’on donne un objet d’évolution, comme une\\nPierre Feu, à un Pokémon qui tient une Pierre\\nStase, l’évolution se déclenchera-t-elle ?\\nA) Oui\\nB) Non",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_03a",
      "hash64": "1F3CAE9C75C7B873",
      "text": "A) Oui",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_03b",
      "hash64": "1F3CAF9C75C7BA26",
      "text": "B) Non",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_04",
      "hash64": "C44606AE4D4FF71E",
      "text": "4. Quelles sont les chances de croiser un\\nPokémon chromatique ?\\nA) 1 sur 2 000\\nB) 1 sur 4 000\\nC) 1 sur 6 000",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_04a",
      "hash64": "1F54B69C75DC57EC",
      "text": "A) 1 sur 2 000",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_04b",
      "hash64": "1F54B99C75DC5D05",
      "text": "B) 1 sur 4 000",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_04c",
      "hash64": "1F54B89C75DC5B52",
      "text": "C) 1 sur 6 000",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_05",
      "hash64": "C44607AE4D4FF8D1",
      "text": "5. Vrai ou faux ? Plumeline a trois\\nformes différentes.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_05a",
      "hash64": "1F50D29C75D89EA9",
      "text": "A) Vrai",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_05b",
      "hash64": "1F50CF9C75D89990",
      "text": "B) Faux",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_06",
      "hash64": "C44604AE4D4FF3B8",
      "text": "/!\\\\ Question sans incidence sur votre note /!\\\\\\n\\nComment avez-vous trouvé mon cours ?\\n(Je sais que j’ai encore des choses à améliorer,\\nmais je me suis beaucoup amusé.)",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_06a",
      "hash64": "1F4DEA9C75D6919A",
      "text": "A) C’était très chouette !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_06b",
      "hash64": "1F4DE99C75D68FE7",
      "text": "B) Merci de nous avoir tant appris !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_06c",
      "hash64": "1F4DE89C75D68E34",
      "text": "C) Vous êtes sur la bonne voie !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_a_08_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "E6120BA4A4133FA4",
      "text": "Le contrôle est terminé, posez vos stylos !\\nAlors, les questions vous ont plu ?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_a_08_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "E6120CA4A4134157",
      "text": "Vous avez dû remarquer que j’ai de nouveau\\nglissé un sondage à la fin de l’épreuve...\\c\\nJe compte sur vous pour ne pas en parler\\nau proviseur.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_a_08_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "E6120DA4A413430A",
      "text": "Je vais noter vos copies tout de suite. J’imagine\\nque vous attendez vos résultats avec impatience ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
